  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEar-EEG FM Benchmark \u2014 preprocessed datasets\n\t\n\nThis repository hosts preprocessed HDF5 files for the Ear-EEG FM Benchmark\n(https://github.com/zhikaili1150/Ear-EEG-FM-Benchmark).\nEach .h5 file follows the schema:\ndata       (N, C, T) float32    \u00b5V\nlabels     (N,)      int64       0..n_class-1\nsubject    (N,)      object      'sub-NN'\nsession    (N,)      object      'ses-NN'\ntrial_id   (N,)      int64\nch_names   (C,)      object      standard 10-20 names\nattrs      sfreq, n_class\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zachary1150/ear-eeg-fm-benchmark-data.",
